    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that’s the thing... there isn’t a \"new path\" when the math just doesn't work. i've looked at the numbers a thousand times. even if i cut everything to the bone, the debt still grows faster than i can earn. it's not like i can just \"rest\" my way out of a deficit that's getting bigger every single day. it feels less like a path and more like a hole i'm digging myself.",
